From: Philippe Gerum <rpm@xenomai.org>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2020 12:30:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0633/1013] evl/flags: add non-destructive evl_peek_flag()

We need a way to peek at a flag state without clearing it if set.

Signed-off-by: Philippe Gerum <rpm@xenomai.org>
---
 include/evl/flag.h | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/evl/flag.h b/include/evl/flag.h
index afebf811a0d3..7f59406e89ba 100644
--- a/include/evl/flag.h
+++ b/include/evl/flag.h
@@ -34,6 +34,12 @@ static inline void evl_destroy_flag(struct evl_flag *wf)
 	evl_destroy_wait(&wf->wait);
 }
 
+static inline bool evl_peek_flag(struct evl_flag *wf)
+{
+	smp_wmb();
+	return wf->raised;
+}
+
 static inline bool evl_read_flag(struct evl_flag *wf)
 {
 	if (wf->raised) {
